stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: Agent creates workflow

    Draft --> PendingApproval: Submitted to queue
    Draft --> Cancelled: Requester cancels

    PendingApproval --> UnderReview: Approver opens
    PendingApproval --> Escalated: SLA timeout (24h)
    Escalated --> UnderReview: Escalation approver opens

    UnderReview --> Approved: Single approver approves\n(Low / Medium risk)
    UnderReview --> AwaitingSecondApproval: First approver approves\n(High / Critical risk)
    UnderReview --> Rejected: Approver rejects
    UnderReview --> NeedsInfo: Approver requests info
    UnderReview --> Modified: Approver edits steps

    AwaitingSecondApproval --> Approved: Second approver approves
    AwaitingSecondApproval --> Rejected: Second approver rejects

    NeedsInfo --> PendingApproval: Agent responds with info
    Modified --> PendingApproval: Resubmitted after edit

    Approved --> Scheduled: Change window assigned
    Approved --> Executing: Immediate execution\n(Low risk, no change window)

    Scheduled --> Executing: Change window opens

    Executing --> Verifying: All steps complete
    Executing --> RollingBack: Step failure detected

    Verifying --> Completed: Verification passes
    Verifying --> RollingBack: Verification fails\nor side effects detected

    RollingBack --> RolledBack: Rollback succeeds
    RollingBack --> ManualIntervention: Rollback fails

    Completed --> [*]: Audit log written
    Rejected --> [*]: Rejection reason logged
    Cancelled --> [*]: Cancellation logged
    RolledBack --> [*]: Incident created
    ManualIntervention --> [*]: Critical alert sent

    note right of Approved
        Audit entry:
        - Approver identity
        - Timestamp
        - Decision notes
        - Risk tier acknowledged
    end note

    note right of Completed
        Audit entry:
        - Before state
        - Steps executed
        - After state
        - Verification result
        - Savings / risk delta
    end note
